                                "sense_id": "dcd8af7d-c658-3435-850e-ad4b5d644911",
                                "text": "The graceful and animated figure with a Sword in one hand and a Victor’s Crown in the other, and mounted advancingly on the ramparts, explicitly shew the mode in which the place was taken by storm."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "43edbdd0-98ba-4c33-ba20-539757c05c23",
                                "sense_id": "dcd8af7d-c658-3435-850e-ad4b5d644911",
                                "text": "in [old horses] the disease is advancingly destructive"
