                                "sense_id": "dcd8af7d-c658-3435-850e-ad4b5d644911",
                                "text": "I haven’t been privy to the month-by-month deterioration of marriages once robust; I haven’t sniffed the sickly sweet waft of gin off the breath of a formerly industrious realtor at advancingly earlier hours of the afternoon."
